              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ambulātiō, ambulātiōnis — \"a walk, stroll\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Post cēnam ambulātiōnem in hortō facimus. After dinner we take a walk in the garden."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine, third declension, from ambulō. Also a covered walk in a villa."
            }
          ]
        },
