          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ambulātiō is the action noun of ambulō \"to walk\" (Lewis & Short; EtymDB). English ambulance and perambulate come from the same verb."
            }
          ]
        },
