              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Prope rīvum locus amoenus est. There is a lovely spot near the stream."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of gardens, groves and views. Locus amoenus — a pleasant place."
            }
          ]
        },
